  "name": "MOLGENIS EMX2",
  "alternateName": [
    "MOLGENIS",
    "Entity Model eXtension 2"
  ],
  "description": "FAIR research data platform for building and managing biobank catalogues, rare-disease registries, and cohort data portals. Provides a flexible entity-model framework (EMX2), GraphQL API, and built-in data harmonisation support. Used across BBMRI-ERIC, RD-Connect, and ELIXIR-affiliated networks to host federated biobank metadata catalogues and sample directories. Developed at the University of Groningen.",
