  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "Established FAIR research data platform widely deployed across European biobank and rare-disease networks (BBMRI-ERIC, RD-Connect, ELIXIR). 25 forks reflect real institutional deployments that GitHub stars undercount. LGPL-3.0, actively maintained (updated May 2026), GraphQL API enables integration with modern data portals. EMX2 is a significant rewrite of the long-running MOLGENIS platform. Assess for teams building FAIR biobank catalogues or rare-disease data portals in the European research infrastructure landscape; strong overlap with BBMRI-ERIC Negotiator for end-to-end biobank data access workflows.",
